# Lint + typecheck before commit (hard gate)

**Canonical (Claude · Codex · Cursor):** [`scripts/agent-gates/README.md`](../../scripts/agent-gates/README.md) + root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Checks.  
This file is a Cursor always-on mirror — **do not invent a second policy here.**

**编码完成 → scoped lint + typecheck pass → 才允许 `git commit`。**  
**不要**在 commit 前跑 `next build`。push 也不强制 build（已暂停）；pack/on-prem 仍按需 `gate.sh build`。

## Required

1. Web / shared → `npm run lint -w @mesa/web` **and** `npm run typecheck -w @mesa/web`（或 `gate.sh check`）
2. Ops / shared → same for `@mesa/ops`
3. Print-agent → Docker `go vet`（`go test` / 交叉编译留给 pack/tag，不挡日常 push）

Report commands + pass before commit. Waive only if Will says so in-thread.
